<div class="jackpot-win-lead-title">🎉 CHÚC MỪNG BẠN QUAY THƯỞNG TRÚNG 🎉</div>
<h1 class="jackpot-win-main-tier text-shimmer-grand" id="jackpotWinTitle">GRAND JACKPOT</h1>
</div>
